{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026xaMb0AEybd1792745207.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>亞太區股市普遍下跌。</p><p></p><p>日本股市連跌第二日，險守62,000點。綜合全星期累積下跌百分之4。</p><p></p><p>韓國股市周五輕微反彈，但連跌第四周。 </p><p></p><p>台灣股市受颱風吹襲，休市一天。全周錄得累積跌幅逾百分之2。</p><p></p><p>澳洲股市周五回軟，並終止過去三周升勢。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T09:44:41.052883+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T08:38:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T04:58:15.097531+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T09:38:49.287970+00:00","content_hash":"4ebf4aa4a86a1d67c6c203bccce18bba5f6893a82ca8e25d23e3b8c9ba993d94","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T09:44:41.052883+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}